    "title": "New $78 million Tensaw River bridge on track for 2027 opening - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jordyn Lassiter ,\n5 hours ago MOBILE, Ala. (WALA) - A new $78 million bridge over the Tensaw River remains on schedule to open in fall 2027, replacing the aging westbound span near Battleship Park. The current Tensaw River Bridge was built in the 1970s, and transportation standards have improved significantly since then, according to the Alabama Department of Transportation. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
